<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on March 12.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on March 12.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				March 12	     March 11</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.285		  5.542</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	   8.044		  9.437</p>
<p>Cash balance		  13.229		 14.980</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,  subject to limit</p>
<p>			     5,274.317	    5,270.078</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $3 million were issued and $51 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
